WEBVTT

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:03.960
The goddess of fate is smiling upon you.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:07.590
But everyone has at least one day like that.

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.770
Looks like today is that day for you.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.020
I wonder about that.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.150
She's a fickle one, after all.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.010
Well? Want to find out?

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:22.640
You must be tired of winning such small bets.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:27.150
Thanks. I was just starting to get bored.

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:31.670
Let's see. How about we bet on this entire casino?

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.850
Oh, that would be wonderful.

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.230
I own this place.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:39.950
It would offer a bit of excitement.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:44.800
Nevertheless, I don't have anything to bet that equals the worth of your casino.

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:46.800
Oh, but you do.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:48.810
You, yourself.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.810
Your beauty has that much value to it.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:56.890
Myself?

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.900
Sounds interesting.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.070
I'm in.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.400
What a beautiful body.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.900
Men would...

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:47.900
No, even women would surely become enslaved by it.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.410
Mine Fujiko.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.960
Oh, it seems you've heard of me.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.320
I've looked you up, of course.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:00.310
A woman who is thief by day, a spy by night.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:03.840
So mysterious that nobody knows her true identity.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:08.180
You're mine to do with as I please.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.330
I could either let you live, kill you,

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.080
or make you wish you were dead.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:18.470
However, if you grant my two wishes,

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:21.500
I will let you go free.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:22.520
Wishes?

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:23.780
Yes.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:27.650
The first is to steal a gun from a certain man.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:29.210
The second...

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.500
is to see it through to the end.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:35.250
Penne, take her there.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:43.710
For a long time, this town has been ruled by us, the Italian Family.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:49.050
But ever since our last boss was killed and his wife, Cicciolina, took the reins,

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:52.810
the Chinese mafia has completely taken over.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:57.940
That guy was the one who killed our boss and went over to their side.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.860
Jigen Daisuke?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.280
Yes.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:05.560
I want you to steal his .357 Magnum.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.860
What kind of man is he?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.120
He can draw his gun in 0.3 seconds.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:15.960
He's an untouchable bodyguard who's known as the most formidable man in the underground.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.380
And you want me to steal a gun from such a man?

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.650
Don't worry.

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:25.050
He has a single weak point:

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.380
Women.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:30.970
He values his .357 Magnum more than his own life.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.360
If you steal it,

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.770
he will definitely come here.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:39.030
And when he does,

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:43.420
I will kill the man who killed my husband
and defected to our rival organization...

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.940
with my own two hands.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.480
My name is Cicciolina.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.870
Nice to meet you,

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.950
Mine Fujiko.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:59.860
Well? Where exactly are you taking me?

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.460
To the audition stage.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.060
Audition?

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:06.540
Yeah. For the part of Rin-tin-tin's lover.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.660
Hey, bodyguard!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:41.440
This is my new girl, Mine Fujiko.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:43.170
Take care of her.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.670
Nice to meet you, Mr. Bodyguard.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:50.170
Protecting women isn't a bodyguard's job.

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:55.180
Protecting my girls is part of your job as <i>my</i> bodyguard.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.480
Come in.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.520
Oh, you came,

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.720
Mr. Bodyguard.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:38.230
Where's the boss?

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:39.700
He's out.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:42.120
He probably won't be back for a while.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.090
Hey, wait!

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.020
Won't you stay and have some fun?

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:50.180
Since the moment I first saw you, I knew you were a wonderful man.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:52.360
Unfortunately, I'll have to decline.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.250
Oh my, are you afraid of the boss?

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.120
Or do you just not have the guts?

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:00.270
Sadly, I don't like women.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.830
Wait!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.950
Please!

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:06.350
That can't be true, can it?

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:08.700
Don't embarrass me like this.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:09.880
Come on.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:29.470
A lot of people are after the boss.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.990
Some have even posed as his lover to get close to him.

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:36.450
They've made attempts on my life as well.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.380
Here.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:07.850
Hey, are you just the kind of guy who's suspicious of every single person who tries to get close to him?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.390
Or did something painful happen in your past?

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:19.080
If I didn't suspect everybody, I couldn't be a bodyguard.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.560
I see.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:25.390
So it's your job to suspect everything
without trusting anything at all.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:29.330
Hey, are you still suspicious of me?

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:32.170
That knife was only for self defense.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.010
I don't have anything on me today.

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:39.260
Wait.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:44.590
I thought he said it was part of your job to guard me.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.560
You're awfully dutiful.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.830
I'm old fashioned.

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:55.540
It's puzzling.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:10:00.570
Why did a guy like you kill his boss and change sides?

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:03.820
Money?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.330
Or was it... a woman?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:11.240
It has nothing to do with you.

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:14.870
I've heard about you.

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.590
Jigen Daisuke.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:19.090
They say you're quite skilled.

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:22.370
Would you show me?

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:30.660
William Tell, huh?

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:32.990
That's so classic.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.790
I like you, boy.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:10:59.870
Hey!

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:00.970
Wake up!

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.010
Hey!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.270
Hey, call a doctor!

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.920
Let me be.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:15.170
I can't trust anyone.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:20.280
I'll live my life in suspicion.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.540
Just...

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.550
Why did you save me?

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:37.530
You, whose job is to kill people?

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:42.800
Are you telling me you're able to feel things like sympathy and love?

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.440
Forgive me.

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:52.580
No matter how callous a man may seem, he always retains a shred of compassion.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:58.570
And no matter how desperate a woman may seem, she always retains a shred of hope.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:02.820
You... didn't really want to die.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:07.200
That's why I saved you.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.340
What do you think of her?

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.610
What do you mean?

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:17.150
She's tried to kill herself countless times.

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:21.880
She's baffled by life, so she plays around with death.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.630
Honestly, she's too much for me to handle.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:29.920
Still, I love her.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:33.290
I'm just a bodyguard.

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.600
Nothing more, nothing less.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.100
I know.

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.580
But will you still watch her for me?

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:47.950
The bodyguard for a day?

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:50.700
Yes. I want to borrow him.

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.880
I can have some fun every once in a while, right?

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:58.660
Fine.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.710
Do what you want.

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:06.030
Let's dance.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:08.460
That's not a bodyguard's job.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:12.100
Oh, you can't even be a woman's escort?

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:13.810
That's not manly at all.

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.440
Stay close to me.

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:20.960
You're contradicting yourself.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.160
What?

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.200
Kind yet cruel.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.200
Calm yet confused.

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.620
It's very interesting.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:55.430
What do you think you're doing?

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.310
Why don't you ask your body?

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:03.500
What have you done?

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:06.530
I guess you could call it a lovemaking technique.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.020
What?

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:11.760
It's an ancient Chinese secret.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:14.540
How about it? You feel better now, right?

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.180
Damn...

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.210
Now, relax your whole body.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:26.830
Can't you be honest with yourself for once?

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:36.980
Here's a message from her.

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:40.260
"I'll be waiting at the place where we made love."

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.930
She was an ill-natured woman, just as she seemed.

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:20.030
Thank you.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.500
I expected no less.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:24.130
Will he really come?

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:26.720
He will.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:28.890
Without fail.

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:31.530
Will you kill him?

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.930
Now, my other request for you.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.870
See it through to the end.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.640
It couldn't be...

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:11.240
Where are you, Cicciolina?!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.120
Are in you here, Cicciolina?!

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.240
Hey, where are you?!

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:19.740
Hey!

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:23.020
If you get out now, you'll get us both killed.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.750
I can only forget this world...

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.590
while I'm making love with someone.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:31.950
Only then can I...

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:38.850
So...

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:44.310
What's the meaning of this?

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.540
Where were you up until now?

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:49.880
Were you with that bodyguard?!

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.470
What would you do if I was?

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:54.620
You're going to shoot me?

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:56.450
Fine.

00:16:57.540 --> 00:17:00.990
If you love me, kill me.

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:02.930
Not you.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.000
I'm going to kill <i>him</i>!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:06.860
Don't!

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:07.910
Shut up!

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:08.680
Stop it!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:09.460
Let go!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.630
Cicciolina...

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:25.680
Hey, get a grip!

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:26.890
Listen.

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:28.520
I'm the one who killed him.

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:30.570
You had nothing to do with it.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.350
Got it?

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:33.230
What's going on, Boss?!

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:34.510
There he is!

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:35.550
The traitor!

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:36.490
Stop!

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:43.410
So you did come.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:46.160
I'll be seeing this through to the end.

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:49.380
What you stole wasn't my Magnum.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:52.420
You stole my past, my life.

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:59.260
It's been a while.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:00.780
Come off it.

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:02.760
Let's cut the meaningless greetings.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.310
I hear you became the head of the organization.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.660
That's right.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:09.060
I made good use of you.

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:14.180
And you've come here to seal the lips of the guy who knows what happened?

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:17.570
What a puppet you are,

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.320
Mr. Bodyguard!

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.080
Cicciolina and I are together now.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.220
How about it? Are you jealous?

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.030
Did you think she loved you or something?

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.980
I'm grateful.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:33.580
I've finally met a woman who's made me want to kill her.

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:36.090
Let's settle the score.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:46.920
Hey!

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.800
I have one more bullet,

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.000
and it's got your name on it.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.700
I don't know about that.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.040
Can you really shoot me?

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.540
You won't shoot.

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:15.050
Goodbye, Jigen.

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:32.090
Why?

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:36.250
I intended to trick you at first,

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:42.400
but at some point, you became my only hope.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:48.010
After losing you, I was like an empty shell.

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:51.850
I thought about killing you.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:55.360
I thought I might as well just die.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:20:01.420
But if I'm going to die, I wanted you to be the one who killed me.

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.440
I don't understand.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:10.340
I just don't understand.

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:15.090
I saw it through to the end.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:19.690
When you said that, you meant <i>your</i> end.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:25.930
I saw a bit of myself in her.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:30.700
That's why I played the thief for her.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:34.960
Cut it out. This doesn't suit you.

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:38.840
She was killed by her own past.

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:44.500
But I will always outrun mine, no matter how quickly it tries to catch up with me.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:48.280
The ultimate killer is your own past, huh?

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.460
I'm done with being a killer.

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:55.370
In that business, a second's hesitation can cost someone their life.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.370
If you feel any emotion, you're done for.

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:00.610
I can't keep up with it anymore.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.350
So, what will you do now?

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:07.780
Let's see. Maybe I'll take up the carefree life of a thief.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.240
Are you making me an offer?

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:11.400
Don't worry.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.240
No matter what happens, I'll never team up with you.

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:16.100
We'll see about that.

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.620
I might see you again somewhere.
